Conflicts: gnome-wifi-hotspot, gnome-wifi-hotspot-gnome, gnome-wifi-hotspot-tray
Replaces: gnome-wifi-hotspot, gnome-wifi-hotspot-gnome, gnome-wifi-hotspot-tray
Provides: gnome-wifi-hotspot (= @VERSION@), gnome-wifi-hotspot-gnome (= @VERSION@), gnome-wifi-hotspot-tray (= @VERSION@)
Homepage: https://github.com/3togo/gnome-wifi-hotspot
Description: Wi-Fi Relay application with GNOME and tray controls
 Share a Wi-Fi connection through a virtual access point. Includes the GTK4
 settings application, system service, GNOME Shell extension and desktop tray
 controls in one package. Desktop detection selects the appropriate controls.
 GNOME controls support Shell 45 through 51; other desktops use tray controls.
 Concurrent operation requires compatible wireless hardware and drivers.
